    "type": "game",
    "name": "Polterguys: Possession Party",
    "steam_appid": 1043520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;So... what's in the game <strong><i>RIGHT NOW!?&quot;</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're glad you asked! Here's what you get on day one:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 unique levels packed with physics-based traps and toys!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 collectable costume possessions to discover and level up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily and weekly challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leader boards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spooky Trail to travel along for progression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loads of rewards: avatars, emotes, special effects, personalised podiums, and way more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split-screen couch play for up to 4 players, who can also go online together and play as a party!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your own space called your '<strong><i>Haunt</i></strong>'... use candy that you collect to buy new addons for it in game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sabotage</strong> and spite are your greatest allies! Use the monster as a <strong>portable death machine</strong> to destroy your opponents with <i>seemingly</i> harmless abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>tonnes of power-ups and traps</strong> sprinkled about the levels to help you create carnage... the question is can you <strong>make it count</strong> with the monster breathing down your little gooey neck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your powers of possession bring inanimate objects to life! Use them to fight, run away or just <strong><i>look darn good</i></strong> whilst you soak up the chaos unfolding around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Polterguys is a spooky brawlfest where mischievous ghosts are being stalked by a deadly monster who wants to destroy them all! Chaotic? Yes! Competitive? You betcha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So come! Join in the party. After all - Ghouls just wanna have fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;So... what's in the game <strong><i>RIGHT NOW!?&quot;</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're glad you asked! Here's what you get on day one:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 unique levels packed with physics-based traps and toys!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 collectable costume possessions to discover and level up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily and weekly challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leader boards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spooky Trail to travel along for progression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loads of rewards: avatars, emotes, special effects, personalised podiums, and way more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Split-screen couch play for up to 4 players, who can also go online together and play as a party!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your own space called your '<strong><i>Haunt</i></strong>'... use candy that you collect to buy new addons for it in game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sabotage</strong> and spite are your greatest allies! Use the monster as a <strong>portable death machine</strong> to destroy your opponents with <i>seemingly</i> harmless abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>tonnes of power-ups and traps</strong> sprinkled about the levels to help you create carnage... the question is can you <strong>make it count</strong> with the monster breathing down your little gooey neck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your powers of possession bring inanimate objects to life! Use them to fight, run away or just <strong><i>look darn good</i></strong> whilst you soak up the chaos unfolding around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Polterguys is a spooky brawlfest where mischievous ghosts are being stalked by a deadly monster who wants to destroy them all! Chaotic? Yes! Competitive? You betcha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So come! Join in the party. After all - Ghouls just wanna have fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.poster.avif?t=1752276103\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.webm?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.mp4?t=1752276103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Supernatural multiplayer madness where 8 players use sneaky sabotage to get opponents caught by a raging monster! Play as mischievous ghosts who possess everyday objects to gain special powers and show off! Battle in spooky maps full of traps and use wacky powerups to sacrifice your friends!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Finnish, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis delightfully chaotic game for all the family is as kooky as it is spooky . . . and scarily good value for money\u201d<br>The Sun Newspaper<br><br>\u201cPolterguys: Possession Party excels in delivering a fun, chaotic experience that shines brightest in a multiplayer setting.\u201d<br>Drastik Measure<br>",
